        "mentions": [
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
          "char_sun_shi_han",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Gu Masters trapped inside battle space name Grand Chaotic Dance Gu among the Gu that make fighting the flying bear alone hopeless. When Fang Yuan has wolf groups pin the flying bear while others attack from outside battle space range, the flying bear uses this Gu with star river Gu, Wind Tiger Cloud Dragon Gu, and others, and the wolf group takes heavy losses.",
        "chapters": [
          584
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "same-fight-and-later-note",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_wind_tiger_cloud_dragon_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After the round, Mo Yao’s will tells Fang Yuan that accompanying Gu such as battle space Gu, Grand Chaotic Dance Gu, Five Element Bear Skin Gu, and others can greatly raise the battle strength of flying bear phantom Gu beyond the Immortal Gu alone.",
        "chapters": [
          586
        ],
